      "writtenOn": "2024-12-16T16:56:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The latter appraoch sounds good. In fact, we\u0027re [in the process](https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/pull/5018) of specifying Features for all of the compatibility limitations. So I think this could be something like \n\n```\nif (!device-\u003eHasFeature(Feature::FlexibleTextureViews)) { ... }\n```\n\nand then the D3D11 backend (and all Core backends) could advertise support for FlexibleTextureViews.\n\nWould that work?",
      "parentUuid": "d57328db_7dd47081",
